repository-code: "https://github.com/Mukesh-charan/voice-agent-studio-qubo"
abstract: >
  A real-time voice agent system for hospitality and clinic booking, featuring
  QUBO-based task scheduling (QTP) and prompt optimisation (QPO) using
  simulated annealing, tabu search, and QAOA simulation.
